OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recent archive video on YouTube might
OL,7,Fhave surprised some Pres fans.
OL,9,FLast week a video appeared of an
OL,10,Fafternoon junction on BBC Wales in
OL,11,FMarch 1978.
OL,13,FThe gap between the regular midweek
OL,14,Frepeat of Songs of Praise and Play
OL,15,FSchool was bridged by a lengthy
OL,16,Finterval.
OL,18,FTwo things may have surprised some.
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12602
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst of all, there was no regional
OL,7,Fnews bulletin immediately before Play
OL,8,FSchool.
OL,10,FIn Radio Times this bulletin was billed
OL,11,Fwith words such as "except London,
OL,12,FScotland".
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland had a bulletin so,
OL,15,Fgiven the RT billing, it would have
OL,16,Fbeen natural to assume Wales did too.
OL,18,FThere is probably a simple explanation
OL,19,Ffor this misunderstanding.
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12603
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a general rule, pages in RT were
OL,7,Fonly changed because of actual regional
OL,8,Fprogrammes and schedule changes.
OL,10,FIn English regions, this normally meant
OL,11,Fchanging the Monday evening page to
OL,12,Fbill the appropriate regional news
OL,13,Fprogramme ` on other days a generic
OL,14,Fdescription appeared.
OL,16,FPages covering other English regional
OL,17,Fopts ` which were normally at standard
OL,18,Ftimes across the network ` were also
OL,19,Fmodified.
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12604
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Scotland and Northern Ireland, of
OL,7,Fcourse, far more modification was
OL,8,Fnecessary. There were more schedule
OL,9,Fchanges and both Reporting Scotland and
OL,10,FScene Around Six got a daily billing.
OL,12,FHowever many pages still went through
OL,13,Funtouched. It would have been wasteful
OL,14,Fto routinely change a whole page in the
OL,15,FScottish or London editions for the
OL,16,Fsake of a short news summary in small
OL,17,Ftype.
OL,19,FWales was in a different position
OL,20,Fthough.
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12605
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll programme pages in the Wales
OL,7,Fedition were modified to refer to "BBC
OL,8,FCymru Wales" rather than "BBC 1" even
OL,9,Fon the unusual occasions where there
OL,10,Fwere no schedule variations.
OL,12,FThere was consequently no need to amend
OL,13,Fthe regional news billing leaving some
OL,14,FPres fans to understandably assume
OL,15,Fthere was a bulletin in Wales.
OL,17,FIt is interesting though that both BBC
OL,18,FScotland and BBC Wales didn't seem to
OL,19,Fthink a mid-afternoon news summary was
OL,20,Fan appropriate use of their resources.
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12606
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis brings us to the other point of
OL,7,Fsurprise.
OL,9,FIn the late-70s Scotland, Northern
OL,10,FIreland and the English regions usually
OL,11,Fonly covered the evening junctions `
OL,12,Fbeginning with the link into the
OL,13,FEvening News. Network continuity
OL,14,Fappeared the rest of the time unless
OL,15,Fthere was an opt, such as a regional
OL,16,Fschools programme.
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12607
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Scotland, the network junction
OL,7,Fnormally appeared in the run up to Play
OL,8,FSchool. English regions and Northern
OL,9,FIreland probably came out of the
OL,10,Fnetwork interval on this day when it
OL,11,Fwas time for the local news.
OL,13,FAs far as we know, Presentation in
OL,14,FCardiff routinely covered far more of
OL,15,Fthe schedule ` including lunchtime
OL,16,Fprogrammes and the afternoon children's
OL,17,Fsequence.
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12608
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis was partly practical. Wales
OL,7,Fbroadcast some Welsh language
OL,8,Fchildren's programmes at lunchtime and
OL,9,Fduring the main afternoon block.
OL,10,FObviously efforts had to be made to
OL,11,Fensure incorrect programme information
OL,12,Fdidn't go out.
OL,14,FWithin the BBC, internal documentation
OL,15,Fof the time appeared to treat BBC Wales
OL,16,Fas a separate channel rather than a
OL,17,Fvariant of BBC One.
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12609
SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt would be interesting to confirm
OL,7,Fwhether BBC Wales covered the whole
OL,8,Fschedule ` schools junctions away from
OL,9,Fopts, weekend mornings and so on.
OL,11,FThe local version of Test Card G was
OL,12,Flabelled as "BBC Wales" rather than
OL,13,F"BBC 1" when it was shown ` ironically
OL,14,Fto replace the afternoon repeats of
OL,15,FWelsh language programmes shown on
OL,16,FEnglish transmitters.
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12610
SC,0010
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the 80s a number of moves took place
OL,7,Fwhich gradually changed the BBC's main
OL,8,Fchannel in Wales into the equivalent of
OL,9,FBBC One Scotland or BBC One Northern
OL,10,FIreland.
OL,12,FThe removal of Welsh language
OL,13,Fprogramming in 1982 reduced the number
OL,14,Fof alterations to the schedule
OL,15,Fsubstantially. The word "Cymru" was
OL,16,Fremoved from the globe, clock and
OL,17,Fslides.
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12611
SC,0011
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 1985, the new COW and presentation
OL,7,Fpackage referred to "BBC 1 Wales"
OL,8,Falthough the announcer still referred
OL,9,Fto BBC Wales verbally.
OL,11,FBy around 1989, the name "BBC 1 Wales"
OL,12,Fwas used by the announcers ` later
OL,13,Fgiven as BBC Wales on One after the
OL,14,F1991 revamp in a move similar to one
OL,15,Fmade in Scotland but not Northern
OL,16,FIreland.
OL,18,FSo an apparently innocuous afternoon
OL,19,Fjunction from 1978 has a story behind
OL,20,Fit.
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12612
SC,0012
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F126A1768768101
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                G12/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1978 BBC Wales continuity clip
OL,4,Ccuriosity
OL,5,
OL,6,FUPDATE: BBC announcer Al Dupres
OL,7,Fprovided some additional insights
OL,8,Fshortly after this article was
OL,9,Fpublished:
OL,11,F"I've been looking at the BBC Wales
OL,12,Fpaperwork for the time. If they weren't
OL,13,Fopting for children's programmes they'd
OL,14,Foften take Network continuity.
OL,16,F"This day is different for some reason,
OL,17,Fand without having the Network
OL,18,Fpaperwork to compare it with makes it
OL,19,Fdifficult but it's possibly
OL,20,FNetwork-promoted England-only
OL,21,Fprogrammes."
OL,23,APub: 16-Mar-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,127,120,200,300,0,100@
